      "source_line_end": 1721,
      "current_tex": "\\begin{theorem}[Supremum of the Absolute-Value Image]\n\\label{thm:supremum-absolute-value-image}\nLet $A\\subseteq\\mathbb{R}$ be nonempty and bounded.  Then\n$|A|:=\\{|a|:a\\in A\\}$ is nonempty and bounded above, and\n\\[\n  \\sup |A|=\\max\\{|\\inf A|,|\\sup A|\\}.\n\\]\n\\hyperref[prf:supremum-absolute-value-image]{Go to proof.}\n\\end{theorem}",
